        "title": "Kandih damthau mak hu nung",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih damthao mak hu nung rui",
            "Akhang cham danlou mei zauzian",
            "Asei Bethlehem guai kai khou",
            "Maansei guan na puan the din ne.",
            "",
            "Guang o, aniu ni kalum kho",
            "Tingkao nthanmei nun guai le",
            "Lung gai lung si baimei nailak khe,",
            "Aniu Raguangh hukhou.",
            "",
            "2. Pou jisu nang Bethlehem khou",
            "Puanc lou khang kaibang makge thei",
            "Alung khou nang khang kai nai e,",
            "Khou hei guang bang na puanc lou o.",
            "",
            "3. Ting puk kandih dam mei kaipou",
            "Ata nang ram zian hei chrin e",
            "Humdai nang guang bam lou duna",
            "Ata thuak lou khang guangc mei hei.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih damthao mak hunung rui",
            "Akhang cham dan loumei kaidai;",
            "Tingsaeng ai lung ni pui ramgai",
            "Tingkao ram gai tei ralou o.",
            "",
            " Pastor Abui"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
